OL,3,GNEWSAApproval for office blocks scheme
OL,4,Aon car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlan to redevelop a car park in Preston
OL,7,Fhave been approved.
OL,9,FThe Martin Property Group is going to
OL,10,Fbe build five office blocks on the
OL,11,F780-space plot at the Fishergate
OL,12,Fshopping centre, which the company
OL,13,Fowns.
OL,15,FAt Preston City Council's planning
OL,16,Fcommittee meeting, an agent for the
OL,17,Fscheme dismissed concerns that there
OL,18,Fwas not enough demand for office space
OL,19,Fgiven how many people now worked from
OL,20,Fhome.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
