OL,3,GNEWSAApproval for office blocks scheme
OL,4,Aon car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Staniland said the firm "wouldn't
OL,7,Fbe doing it" if "commercial advice" had
OL,8,Fnot demonstrated the demand was there.
